 # CHANGES for jsonpath-plus
 
+## Unreleased
+
+- Security fix (CVE-2024-21534): Evaluate filter/script expressions with
+    a restricted, dependency-free expression interpreter instead of Node's
+    `vm`/`new Function`; block access to `constructor`, `__proto__`, etc.
+
 ## 6.0.1 (2021-07-07)
 
 - Fix: Some `package.json` paths needed updating (@matushorvath)
