+ * `false`, `null`, `undefined`), arrays, identifiers (only those
+ * supplied via the sandbox), member access, calls, unary, binary,
+ * logical and ternary operators, (compound) assignment to identifiers
+ * and `var`/`let`/`const` prefixes in `;`-separated statements.
+ *
